    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft! Experiment! Defend!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In DwarfHold you stack tokens to craft! Build tools to harvest better resources, and create towers to defend your village from enemies! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine, forage and forest to get resources. Experiment with combinations of tokens to discover new recipes. Relax with your dwarves, see what you can make, and how long you can survive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2692\ufe0f Mine, forage and forest</strong> to get resouces.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83e\uddea <strong>Experiment</strong> with cominations of tokens to dicsover new recipes. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Defend</strong> your settlement with towers you've crafted.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\ude99 Earn</strong> new locations and ingredients from selling supplies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\ude0e Relax</strong> with your dwarves, see what you can make, and how long you can survive!</p></li></ul>",
